  "body": "Step 10 in [handle response end of file](https://xhr.spec.whatwg.org/#handle-response-end-of-file) isn't implemented by any web browser and the extra progress event seems somewhat superfluous since several other events can tell you when the request is done. I suggest removing step 10 to align the spec with current implementations.\n",
